# What the panel writes into a session's own folder: a picture pasted into the
# composer, and a copy of a file dropped on it that carried no path of its own.
# Both are scratch for one message — the pictures are swept after a fortnight —
# so neither belongs in a commit. This covers the panel's own checkout; every
# other repository the panel writes into needs the same two lines.
